From 4aeacb5f40ddcab28c9a05fca51b1a53d628db59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MT6797 compile experiment <nobody@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mediatek: add private MT6797 register and INIT
 transport

Provide ordered logical-register reads and bounded ordinary-section
CONFIG/ACK/PDA execution with one retained transaction and deadline.
The existing provider must own power, mapping and exclusion. No
registration, mapping acquisition or runtime caller is added.

Internal compile experiment only; not an upstream submission.
The synthetic author is non-certifying; no DCO is asserted.
Assisted-by: LLM
